                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2884779,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "It's got cooking facilities, firewood, and water for drinking. For washing, we recommend you use melted snow, though, to conserve supplies. We can take your luggage up on our snowmobile for you for just $10 a person. The hut has cooking facilities, so you can make a hot meal in the evening and morning, but you need to take your own food. The weather on Mount Frenner can be very stormy.",
